                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Benihadadi, omugabe wa Siria, yaateerana hamwe eihe rye ryona, yaakwatanisa n'abandi bagabe makumi ashatu na babiri, abaabaire baine embaraasi n'ebigaari; yainamuka, yaagota Samaria, yaagirwanisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaatuma entumwa omu rurembo ahari Ahabu omugabe wa Israeli, yaamugira ati: Oku nikwo Benihadadi arikugamba naagira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efeeza zaawe n'ezaabu zaawe n'ebyangye; abakazi baawe abarikuhita abandi boona, n'abaana baawe, nabo n'abangye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe wa Israeli yaamugarukamu ati: Nk'oku waagira, Nyakusinga Omugabe, ndi owaawe n'ebyangye byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima ezo ntumwa zaagaruka ahari Ahabu, zaamugira ziti: Oku nikwo Benihadadi arikugamba naagira ati: Nkutumireho ningira nti: Nyoherereza efeeza zaawe n'ezaabu zaawe, abakazi baawe n'abaana baawe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbwenu nyencakare nk'aga magingo niinyija kukutumaho abashaija bangye, nibacaaka enju yaawe n'amaju g'abagaragwa baawe; eki baraagweho kyona ekirikubashemeza, nibakitwara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
