                {
                  "text": "11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Okuruga aho omugabe wa Israeli yaayeta abakuru b'ensi ye, yaabagira ati: Mbwenu mwetegyereze, mureebe omushaija ogu, ku arikutaara akabi; ahabw'okuba abaire yantumireho abakazi bangye, n'abaana, n'efeeza, n'ezaabu, kandi timmwangiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuru boona n'abantu boona baamugira bati: Otakitaho omutima, kandi otaikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo yaagira entumwa za Benihadadi ati: Mugambire mukama wangye omugabe muti: Byona ebi obandize kutuma aha mwiru waawe, niinyija kubikora; kwona eki tindikwija kukikora. Entumwa zaagyenda, zaamugambira ebi Ahabu yaazituma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.19.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 19:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Benihadadi yaamutumaho naamugira ati: Engabo zangye zoona ezirikunkuratira ku ziraahikwe omucuucu gwa Samaria, buri muntu yaabona ogurikwijuza oruhi, baaruhanga bakinture n'okukiraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe wa Israeli yaagarukamu ati: Orikujwara eby'okurwanisa naaza aha rugamba, arekye kwehimbisa nk'orikubijuura yaatabaarukire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwo Benihadadi akaba ari omu rusiisira naanywa n'abandi bagabe; ku yaahuriire obwo butumwa, yaagira engabo ze ati: Mutengye orugamba. Batyo baatenga orugamba kurwanisa orurembo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
