            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.18.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 18:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahonaaho nabi yairira haihi Ahabu omugabe wa Israeli, yaamugira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Waareeba engabo ziriya zoona oku ziri nyingi? Eri izooba niinyija kuzihayo omu mikono yaawe, omanye ku ndi MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu yaamubuuza ati: Ou araakorese n'oha? Onu ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: N'abashaija b'abategyeki b'amashaza. Yaagaruka yaamubuuza ati: oraatandikye orwo rugamba n'oha? Yaamugarukamu ati: Niiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo yaateerana abashaija b'abategyeki b'amashaza; baaba magana abiri na makumi ashatu na babiri; bwanyima yaabo yaateerana Abaisraeli boona, baaba enkumi mushanju.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baahurura omu ihangwe, Benihadadi ari omu rusiisira naayenywera asinzire, we n'abo bagabe makumi ashatu na babiri abaabaire baizire kumuha emikono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abashaija b'abategyeki b'amashaza baaba nibo baabanza kuhurura. Bwanyima Benihadadi yaatuma entatsi, zaamugira ziti: Twareeba abashaija nibaruga omuri Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagira ati: Ku baraabe bareetwa obusingye, mubakwate bahuriire; kandi ku baraabe bareetwa okurwana, nabwo mubakwate bahuriire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batyo abo bashaija b'abategyeki b'amashaza baaruga omu rurembo n'eihe ribakuratiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buri muntu yaayeitira omuntu we; Abasiria baahunga, Abaisraeli baababinga, kwonka Benihadadi omugabe wa Siria yaahungira aha mbaraasi n'abatembire embaraasi, yaakira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe wa Israeli nawe yaahurura, yaakwata embaraasi n'ebigaari, yaita Abasiria baingi munonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima nabi ogwo yairira haihi omugabe wa Israeli, yaamugira ati: Irooko oyehamye, oteekateekye oku oshemereire kutwaza; ahabw'okuba omu kutandika kw'omwaka omugabe wa Siria aryagaruka kukurwanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima abagaragwa b'omugabe wa Siria baamugira bati: Manya baaruhanga baabo ni baaruhanga b'ebibungo; nikyo baatukiriize amaani; mbwenu murekye turwanire nabo omu mpita, buzima nitwija kubakiza emikono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati twaza oti; ihaho abo bagabe, buri omwe omwihe omu mwanya gwe, omu myanya yaabo otemu abakuru b'engabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi oteerane eihe eririkwingana n'eihe eri ofeereirwe, ogarure embaraasi omu mwanya gw'embaraasi, n'ekigaari omu mwanya gw'ekigaari; haza turwanire nabo omu mpita; buzima nitwija kubakiza emikono. Yaahurira ebi barikugamba, yaatwaza atyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwaka ku gwabaire nigutandika, Benihadadi yaateerana hamwe Abasiria, yainamuka Afeki kurwanisa Abaisraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'Abaisraeli baateeranirwa hamwe, baaheebwa entanda, baaza kubarwanisa. Abaisraeli baateera orusiisira omu maisho gaabo nibashusha nk'obusyo bukye bubiri bw'embuzi, kwonka Abasiria bo baashweka ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushaija wa Ruhanga yairira haihi, yaagambira omugabe wa Israeli, ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'Abasiria okugira ngu, MUKAMA ni Ruhanga w'ebibungo, ti ruhanga w'empita, nikyo ndaaheereyo engabo ziriya enyingi munonga omu mikono yaanyu; nibwo muraamanye ku ndi MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamara ebiro mushanju bari omu nsiisira ezirikureebana. Bwanyima aha izooba rya mushanju orugamba rwatandika; Abaisraeli baita omu ngabo z'Abasiria abantu akasiriira kamwe omu izooba rimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandi baahungira omu rurembo rwa Afeki; orugo rwarwo rw'amabaare rwagwera ababaire baahonokaho obukumi bubiri n'enkumi mushanju. Benihadadi nawe yaahunga, yaataah omu rurembo, yaaza omu kishengye ky'omunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagaragwa be baamugira bati: Reeba, tuhuriire ngu abagabe b'enju ya Israeli n'abagabe b'embabazi. Nitukweshengyereza, twikirize twezirikye ebiguniya, twekome emigoye omu mitwe, tushohore, tuze aha mugabe wa Israeli; obundi akaakiza amagara gaawe, oreka kufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batyo baayezirika ebiguniya omunda, baayekoma emigoye omu mitwe, baaza aha mugabe wa Israeli, baagira bati: Omwiru waawe Benihadadi naagira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, ndeka, ngumeho. Onu yaagira ati: Biri akiriho? Ni mwene tata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwo abo bashaija bakaba bamutaireho eriisho, ngu bamanye ekiri omu biteekateeko bye; ku baakihuriire bati, baakiijaho, bati: Eego, Benihadadi ni mwene sho. Ahabu yaagira ati: Mugyende mumureete. Bwanyima Benihadadi yaashohora, yaija ah'ari, yaamutembesa omu kigaari kye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.15.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 15:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Benihadadi yaamugira ati: Endembo ezi tata yaanyagire sho, niinyija kuzigarura; kandi oryayegirira amaduuka omuri Damasiko, nk'oku sho yaagagizire omuri Samaria. Ahabu yaagira ati: ku oraagire otyo, ninkurekura. Atyo yaakora nawe endagaano, yaamurekura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
