              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omushaija omwe ow'omuri batabani ba baanabi yaagambira mugyenzi we ekigambo eki MUKAMA amuragiire ati: Ninkweshengyereza, nteera. Onu yaayanga kumuteera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 13:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima yaamugira ati: Ahabw'okutahurira iraka rya MUKAMA, ku oraabe wandugaho oti, entare neekwita. Atyo ku yaabaire yaamurugaho, entare yaamubugana, yaamwita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagaruka yaareeba ondiijo mushaija, yaamugira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, nteera. Ogwo mushaija yaamuteera, yaamuhutaaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.28.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 28:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Atyo nabi ogwo yaagyenda, yaategyereza omugabe aha rubaju rw'omuhanda, yaayehindura okundi ayekomire ekitambaara aha maisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.10.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 10:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omugabe ku yaabaire naahinguraho, nabi ogwo yaamweta, yaagira ati: Nyowe omwiru waawe ngiire omu rugamba; bwanyima reeba, omushaija yaakubuuka, yandeetera omushaija, yangira ati: Rinda omushaija ogu. Ku araabure, noomuzira; nari noija kuriha etalanta emwe y'efeeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka nyowe omwiru waawe ku mbaire nindabanamu ninkora oku n'oku, yaabura. Omugabe wa Israeli yaamugira ati: Orubanja rwawe nikwo ruraabe rutyo; niiwe waarwecwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabi ogwo yaarahuka yaiha ekitambaara aha maisho; omugabe wa Israeli yaamumanya ku ari ow'omuri baanabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'okurekura omushaija ou mbaire mpaireyo kwitirwa kimwe, amagara gaawe nigaija kuzira age, n'abantu baawe bazire abe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 21:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omugabe wa Israeli yaagaruka Samaria, yaataaha omu nju ye aine enaku kandi agwirwe kubi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
